{'symbol': 'BALL', 'date': '2022-09-21 16:30:00', 'title': 'BALL CORPORATION COMPLETES SALE OF RUSSIAN BEVERAGE PACKAGING BUSINESS TO ARNEST GROUP FOR $530 MILLION', 'text': 'WESTMINSTER, COLO. , SEPT. 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FOLLOWING THE MARCH, 2022 DECISION TO DIVEST FROM THE RUSSIAN MARKET, BALL CORPORATION (NYSE: BALL) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS COMPLETED THE SALE OF ITS BEVERAGE PACKAGING BUSINESS IN RUSSIA TO ARNEST\xa0GROUP\xa0FOR $530 MILLION.'}